            <strong class="text-white font-semibold">IT Support Engineer L2 & Service Desk Co-Leader</strong> with 5+ years managing 2,500+ endpoints, Microsoft 365/Azure environments, and disaster recovery. Building agentic AI tooling to eliminate operational toil.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Key Metrics Cards -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 pt-2">
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 space-y-1">
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold font-mono text-white">2,500+</div>
