          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 space-y-1">
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold font-mono text-white">1,100+</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium">Security Assets Administered</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 space-y-1">
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold font-mono text-white">25+</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium">Enterprise Projects Delivered</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 space-y-1">
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold font-mono text-emerald-400">&gt;90%</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium">Customer Satisfaction (CSAT)</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Primary CTAs -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 pt-2">
          <a 
            href="#contact" 
            class="px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-slate-950 font-bold text-sm transition-colors shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/10"
          >
            Get in Touch
          </a>
          <a 
            href="#experience" 
            class="px-5 py-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-200 border border-slate-800 text-sm font-medium transition-colors"
          >
            View Work History &darr;
          </a>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 ml-auto text-slate-400 text-sm">
            <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/robiul-hasan-401296137" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">
              LinkedIn &rarr;
            </a>
            <a href="https://github.com/Daddy-Ousen" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">
              GitHub &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </section>

      <!-- ABOUT SECTION -->
      <section id="about" class="space-y-6 pt-8 border-t border-slate-800">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">About</span>
          <div class="h-px bg-slate-800 flex-1"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-8">
          <div class="md:col-span-4 space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Enterprise Infrastructure & Systems Leadership</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Dhaka, Bangladesh &bull; Native Bengali, Fluent English, Basic French</p>
          </div>

          <div class="md:col-span-8 space-y-4 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-base">
            <p>
              I'm an IT infrastructure and support engineer based in Dhaka, with 5+ years keeping enterprise environments reliable — from Microsoft 365 and Azure administration to endpoint security and business continuity.
            </p>
            <p>
              I currently work as an <strong class="text-white">L2 Support Engineer and Service Desk Co-Leader at Techants Solutions</strong>, where I coordinate technical delivery across 25+ IT projects and manage infrastructure for 2,500+ endpoints and 1,100+ security assets across a diverse client portfolio. I co-lead a 10+ person service desk team — training L1 staff, owning quarterly BCDR reporting, and deploying disaster-recovery agents — while holding customer satisfaction above 90%.
            </p>
            <p>
              Before Techants, I built my troubleshooting and infrastructure fundamentals as a Support Engineer at Cobait Dhaka and an IT Executive at AQSBD.
            </p>
            <p>
              I hold Microsoft's <strong class="text-white">Endpoint Administrator (MD-102)</strong> and <strong class="text-white">Modern Desktop Administrator (MD-100)</strong> certifications, and I've extended that foundation with self-directed work in Python, Linux administration, and agentic AI.
            </p>
            <p class="text-white font-medium">
              I am currently exploring roles in systems administration and cloud infrastructure.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
