                Oct 2022 – Present
              </span>
            </div>

            <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed list-disc list-inside">
              <li>Led delivery and technical coordination for 25+ enterprise IT projects across diverse client environments, and collaborated on 5+ additional large-scale rollouts.</li>
              <li>Managed monthly maintenance and monitoring across 2,500+ endpoints and administered antivirus/endpoint security for 1,100+ devices.</li>
              <li>Co-led a 10+ member Service Desk team, training and evaluating L1 staff on new systems, tools, and escalation handling.</li>
              <li>Delivered quarterly BCDR reports and deployed backup/disaster-recovery agents across client endpoints; maintained SDO compliance.</li>
              <li>Sustained customer satisfaction above 90% while managing complex escalations across multiple concurrent client accounts.</li>
            </ul>
