            <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-slate-300">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>Python & Bash Scripting</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>Agentic LLM Workflow Automation</li>
